{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56297","headline":"石门精室诗 · 元□□","name":"石门精室诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竟养浩气稽颡（中缺）戏使石门。\n（按：光绪元年刘沛纂《零陵县志》卷十三君华严岩皇佑初残题名云：「地□古刻石得元□□《石门精舍诗》，知其地也。\n有竟养浩气稽颡〖下缺〗戏使石门之称，与遗迹〖下缺〗其传。\n皇佑乙丑祀明堂日。\n」原刻爲政和间人磨去，今仅存残文。\n疑老□□即爲元结。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元□□","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}